+| 3 (B-3) | f.p. subsection + w.l.o.g. + sentence notes | **DONE** (ssec:fp, prop:fp, rem:nonfg, lem:surj, one-sentence notes at lem:atomic / cor:probecover / lem:sandwich). Content accepted. |
